            "refund_policy": {
                "title": "Refund Policy – Yaro",
                "content": "Effective Date: 15/08/2025\n\n1. General Policy\n\nAll purchases made within Yaro are considered final and non-refundable. We provide virtual content and services such as voice chat access, virtual coins, and premium features. Once purchased, these services are delivered instantly and cannot be reversed.\n\n2. In-App Purchases\n\n• Purchases made via Google Play Store are handled by Google Play's payment system.\n• We do not process or manage payments directly.\n• In rare cases, refunds may be considered if the user experiences technical issues or accidental purchases.\n\n3. Eligibility for Refund\n\nRefund requests will be reviewed on a case-by-case basis and may be approved only under the following conditions:\n\n• Duplicate purchase\n• Technical failure (purchase not delivered)\n• Unauthorized transaction (with valid proof)\n\nTo be eligible for a refund, you must:\n\n• Contact us within 48 hours of the transaction\n• Provide the Order ID and relevant proof (e.g., screenshots, error messages)\n\n4. How to Request a Refund\n\nIf you believe you are eligible for a refund, follow one of these options:\n\nVia Google Play:\n\n1. Open your Google Play account.\n2. Go to \"Order History\".\n3. Find the transaction and tap \"Report a Problem\".\n4. Select the appropriate reason and submit the form.\n\nOr Contact Us Directly:\n\nEmail: support@yaroapp.in\nInclude:\n\n• Your Name\n• Google Order ID (starting with GPA.)\n• Reason for refund request\n• Screenshot (if applicable)\n\n5. Refund Timeframe\n\nIf approved, refunds will be issued to the original payment method within 5–10 business days, depending on your bank or Google Play policy.\n\n6. No Refunds For:\n\n• Change of mind\n• Partially used services (e.g., consumed coins or completed chats)\n• Misuse or violation of terms\n• Requests after 48 hours of purchase\n\n7. Contact Us\n\nFor support or refund requests, please contact us via:\n\nSupport Email: support@yaroapp.in\nIn-App Support Section: Available in App Settings\n\nBy purchasing in the app, you agree to this Refund Policy."
            },
